  "contentHtml": "<p>&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\"><b>버전4 가 현재 최종버전입니다.</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\"><b>(버전4) <a href=\"https://gemini.google.com/share/eef136cbf763\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://gemini.google.com/share/eef136cbf763</a></b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\"><b>마지막 AI에게&#160; 길이, 어투 등 수정 요청 및 복사 기능 추가</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><b>(버전3)&#160;<a href=\"https://gemini.google.com/share/7551e78a594c\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://gemini.google.com/share/7551e78a594c</a></b></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><b>수정내용이 반영이 안 된다는 피드백을 주셔서 반영되도록 수정하고, 최종AI종합문구가 너무 장황한 느낌이라 조금 단순화시켰습니다.</b></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">(버전2)&#160;<a href=\"https://gemini.google.com/share/5f3678cce3b3\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://gemini.google.com/share/5f3678cce3b3</a></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">각 증거행동을 수정하실 수 있게 수정했습니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">학교급에 따라 다른 내용으로 일부 수정하시거나, 선생님의 학급에서 자주 관찰되는 증거행동으로 수정하십시오.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">(버전1)글에 이런 페이지 만드는 방법 올려두었습니다. 한 번 읽어보시면 정말 쉽게 만들 수 있다는 걸 아실 수 있습니다!</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/womenforthefuture/6DU7/1124\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://cafe.daum.net/womenforthefuture/6DU7/1124</a></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1UBcp/b6eff94c89b7c14062749bedc872257b4793b9cf\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1UBcp/b6eff94c89b7c14062749bedc872257b4793b9cf\" data-origin-width=\"790\" data-origin-height=\"607\"></div><p><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/womenforthefuture/6DU7/1124\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://cafe.daum.net/womenforthefuture/6DU7/1124</a></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1UBcp/b6eff94c89b7c14062749bedc872257b4793b9cf_re_1764778518624\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1UBcp/b6eff94c89b7c14062749bedc872257b4793b9cf_re_1764778518624\" data-origin-width=\"790\" data-origin-height=\"607\"></div><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1UBcp/4fccb2df38e8ce165c1b2a1030686d20c1738988_re_1764778518625\" data-origin-width=\"785\" data-origin-height=\"744\" style=\"width:43.99%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1UBcp/4fccb2df38e8ce165c1b2a1030686d20c1738988_re_1764778518625\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1UBcp/5bc523a554cc10806790803a1aa9d2530bed09b9_re_1764778518625\" data-origin-width=\"802\" data-origin-height=\"597\" style=\"width:56.01%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1UBcp/5bc523a554cc10806790803a1aa9d2530bed09b9_re_1764778518625\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
